What are you saying?

255
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:40,560
It appears that you've lost your touch.

256
00:18:43,220 --> 00:18:44,640
Farrow, watch out!

257
00:18:46,140 --> 00:18:47,500
Farewell, Farrow.

258
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:54,960
My king, you're safe now.

259
00:18:57,420 --> 00:19:01,140
Another of your mindless minions
goes to the Shadow Realm.

260
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:02,680
He's my friend!

261
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,220
Was your friend.

262
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:07,266
I don't think he's of
much use to you anymore.

263
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,440
But there is a bright sign.

264
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,860
You'll be joining him shortly.

265
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:13,940
All of you will.

266
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:18,221
For in a matter of moments, darkness
will blanket the entire world.

267
00:19:18,740 --> 00:19:19,570
Shaddaa.

268
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,537
Know this, my friend.

269
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,980
Your actions will not be in vain.

270
00:19:26,220 --> 00:19:28,460
I will defeat this menace.

271
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:35,380
Your pharaoh friend must be
knee-deep in darkness by now.

272
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:38,933
And the only thing that can
save him is locked down here.
